    <DataNode elementId="AT5G58560-MONOMER" textLabel="prenyl alcohol kinase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q67ZM7" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="215" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="PMN, THE-ARABIDOPSIS-INFORMATION-RESOURCE, dreher">FOLK is a |FRAME: 2-TRANS6-TRANS-FARNESOL farnesol| kinase that can also act on |FRAME: GERANIOL| and |FRAME: CPD-9087| |CITS: [21395888]|. This enzyme might play a role in protecting Arabidopsis cells from a toxic build-up of several intermediates produced during the removal and |FRAME: PWY-6577 recycling of farnesylated compounds| from farnesylated proteins |CITS: [17425716]|. Experiments performed using membranes from Arabidopsis demonstrate that the enzyme responsible for producing |FRAME: CPD-12587| (FP) can accept ATP, CTP, GTP, or UTP. FOLK appears to be the sole enzyme responsible for this activity in |FRAME: ORG-5993| because &lt;i&gt;folk&lt;/i&gt; mutants that do not express the gene have no measurable farnesol kinase activity |CITS: [21395888]|. Expression of this enzyme in yeast also led to the production of |FRAME: CPD-12587 FP|, however, the nucleotide preference of the enzyme could not be determined in that experimental system. There was no indication that |FRAME: AT5G58560 FOLK| phosphorylated |FRAME: CPD-12587 FP| to produce |FRAME: CPD-12587| in yeast. These results, in combination with the work done using Arabidopsis membrane fractions, indicate that a separate CTP-dependent enzyme likely acts as the |FRAME: CPD-12587 FP| kinase in |FRAME: ORG-5993| |CITS: [21395888]|. Interestingly, the phenotype of &lt;i&gt;folk&lt;/i&gt; mutants reveals that they may play a role in abscisic acid signaling and carpel formation in |FRAME: ORG-5993| |CITS: [21395888]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT5G58560-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT5G58560.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q67ZM7" />
